B.agg=new A.eU("1. Controller","Cercle, Vienna, Austria. Contact for data protection matters: privacy@cercle.club.")
B.ag8=new A.eU("2. Data we collect","Account: name, email address, phone number (if used for login). Profile: photos, headline, prompt answers, gender, approximate location (city / district \u2014 never precise GPS), Instagram / LinkedIn handles (used only to verify you are a real person). Activity: availability, likes and passes, matches, messages, plans you host or join, post-event feedback. Technical: device type, app version, and server logs.")
B.ag6=new A.eU("3. Purposes of processing","Operating the membership club: reviewing applications, running matching and discovery, enabling communication between members, organising plans and events, keeping the community safe, and providing customer support.")
B.agc=new A.eU("4. Legal basis (Art. 6 GDPR)","Art. 6(1)(b) \u2014 performance of the membership contract (your profile, matching, messaging). Art. 6(1)(f) \u2014 our legitimate interest in a safe, curated community (application review, moderation, abuse prevention). Art. 6(1)(a) \u2014 your consent, where asked (e.g. optional features).")
B.agq=new A.eU("5. Retention","Profile and account data are kept until you delete your account, after which they are erased without undue delay. Server and security logs are kept for 90 days. Aggregated, non-identifying statistics may be kept longer.")
B.ags=new A.eU("6. Your rights","You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability, and to object to processing based on legitimate interest. You may withdraw consent at any time. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority (Datenschutzbeh\xf6rde, dsb.gv.at).")
B.ag3=new A.eU("7. Third parties / processors","Supabase (database, auth, storage) hosted on AWS in the EU (eu-west). Apple and Google for push notifications and app distribution. RevenueCat for subscription management. Processors act only on our instructions under data-processing agreements.")
B.age=new A.eU("8. International transfers","Data is stored in the EU. Where a processor involves a transfer outside the EEA, it is covered by an adequacy decision or standard contractual clauses.")
B.ag1=new A.eU("9. Contact","Data protection requests: privacy@cercle.club. General: vienna@cercle.club.")
